      "v": 20,
      "zh": "耶和华必不饶恕他；耶和华的怒气与愤恨要向他发作，如烟冒出，将这书上所写的一切咒诅都加在他身上。耶和华又要从天下涂抹他的名，",
      "en": "The Lord will be unwilling to forgive him, and his intense anger[NOTE:1] will rage[NOTE:2] against that man; all the curses[NOTE:3] written in this scroll will fall upon him,[NOTE:4] and the Lord will obliterate his name from memory.[NOTE:5]",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “the wrath of the Lord and his zeal.” The expression is a hendiadys, a figure in which the second noun becomes adjectival to the first.",
